  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;the angle between diagonals <math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></math> is <math><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not defined</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
